          "type": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Q1：Your recent Venustas heated apparel.",
            "body": "<p>What started as quiet little adventures slowly turned into a YouTube channel about nature, slow living, campfire cooking, rain, animals, and escaping the noise of everyday life.<br/><br/>I think I love creating music for the same reason I love being outdoors — both make me feel alive, calm, and connected to something bigger. I recently tried a heated hoodie… and honestly, it became one of my favorite things almost instantly.<br/><br/>Hoodies are already basically my everyday uniform, so this felt weirdly perfect for me.<br/><br/>At first I thought it would only be useful for camping or hiking in the mountains, but now I wear it everywhere — walking my dog, riding my bike around the city, late evening shoots, rainy days…<br/><br/>It’s one of those things you try once and suddenly can’t imagine not having anymore.</p>"
          }
        },
