          "settings": {
            "heading": "Q2: How does Venustas heated apparel change your lifestyle?",
            "body": "<p>Heated clothes make any of my walks or hiking much more comfortable, I no longer need to insulate myself with layers of clothes, I can use one heated thing, not take extra things with me and not worry about freezing, it completely changes the level of comfort and my activity.</p>"
